mago is the open-source core: the agent runtime, company model, task routing,
skills, review/merge policy and the GitHub-backed worker. It runs standalone —
no account, no licence key, no hosted service. You bring your own GitHub token
and your own LLM harness.

The hosted control plane at https://mago.intrane.fr (accounts, billing, the
GitHub App and the outbound relay) is a separate, private component. It is a
convenience, not a requirement: everything in this repository works without it.
